 as a retro club, where the past and future intertwine in a frantic loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time is a trap. Completing each contract can lead to catastrophe \u2014 and every &quot;peek&quot; might awaken something far more sinister. In this chaos, you must survive, uncover the secret of the portal, and stop the rifts before it's too late. But be careful \u2014 something lurks in the shadows that feeds on your fears and subconscious. Don't peek \u2014 because even a whisper can attract its attention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i>The game supports voice and text chat</i></u>, but enemies can react to sound \u2014 to every word, step, and even breath. Speak quietly, think before you speak \u2014 every word can be your downfall. Welcome to a world where nothing can be fully trusted, and your greatest enemy is your own mind. There is also another shadow, beyond any time or rules \u2014 PvP mode, where one of you turns into a maniac due to frequent portal use.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634220/extras/b024a493dbdd50378648f5de6e56f72d.webp?t=1768562137\" width=400 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>The game</u></i></strong> features a large lobby for socializing, playing, and training. While waiting for other players, to avoid boredom, I made it very spacious and plan to regularly add various mini-games and Easter eggs so you can interact and get to know other players if you don't want to play the main story. I also plan to introduce a collectible system where you can find items hidden in secret corners across different maps. In the future, there will be options to customize your lobby and character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634220/extras/b80db015ee4f6a1672b828a82112dca2.poster.avif?t=1768562137\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634220/extras/b80db015ee4f6a1672b828a82112dca2.webm?t=1768562137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634220/extras/b80db015ee4f6a1672b828a82112dca2.mp4?t=1768562137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634220/extras/16735282bdaf73f3313bd2b7b85a004f.webp?t=1768562137\" width=400 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>The game</u></i></strong> hides unpredictable outcomes that activate depending on your sanity level. Be careful\u2014reality can be dangerous and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634220/extras/21c7b87102e43833b4f94e251545e047.poster.avif?t=1768562137\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634220/extras/21c7b87102e43833b4f94e251545e047.webm?t=1768562137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634220/extras/21c7b87102e43833b4f94e251545e047.mp4?t=1768562137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634220/extras/8c273634911be4cefa4f0abba10d7be9.webp?t=1768562137\" width=350 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>A smart AI</u></i></strong> responds to your actions\u2014its voice and footsteps are difficult to deceive. Additionally, an AI capable of learning will be added, making it harder for you to survive the longer you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634220/extras/304f908562427f48e16691717d4e676f.poster.avif?t=1768562137\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634220/extras/304f908562427f48e16691717d4e676f.webm?t=1768562137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634220/extras/304f908562427f48e16691717d4e676f.mp4?t=1768562137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634220/extras/1c3693e11f2e0c9aaad5430387cabf38.webp?t=1768562137\" width=270 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>The game</u></i></strong> implements a hide-and-seek system \u2014 they can be dangerous and don\u2019t always guarantee safety, so it's not recommended to stay hidden for too long.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634220/extras/24e4c4ac72a94f95f7913a68b1b20043.poster.avif?t=1768562137\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634220/extras/24e4c4ac72a94f95f7913a68b1b20043.webm?t=1768562137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634220/extras/24e4c4ac72a94f95f7913a68b1b20043.mp4?t=1768562137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634220/extras/32e9ce510fd73af0486326a2f284c8f5.webp?t=1768562137\" width=400 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>There</u></i></strong> is a corner-peeking mechanic that allows you to check for enemies before moving forward. However, be cautious: staring at an opponent for too long may attract their attention. Use this tactical move wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634220/extras/cb44fbd8d8559afee73ebfc7f887e16a.poster.avif?t=1768562137\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634220/extras/cb44fbd8d8559afee73ebfc7f887e16a.webm?t=1768562137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634220/extras/cb44fbd8d8559afee73ebfc7f887e16a.mp4?t=1768562137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634220/extras/dfd90da5b140e9b86d2f2823ce617029.avif?t=1768562137\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p>","developers":["SL Entertainment"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634220/948bf86ca84603f6120b8aefed1bcaf281973720/header.jpg?t=1768562137","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"End User License Agreement (EULA) for \"Don\u2019t Peek\"  by SL Entertainment<br />\r\n","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requir